<h3 class=3D"text-lg font-bold text-text-100 mt-1 -mb-1.5">=F0=9F=93=96 use=
Effect - Side Effect Management</h3>
<h4 class=3D"text-base font-bold text-text-100 mt-1">=F0=9F=8C=B1 Side Effe=
cts trong Functional Programming</h4>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Functional programming prefer <s=
trong>pure functions</strong> - functions without side effects. Nh=C6=B0ng =
real-world applications c=E1=BA=A7n side effects: API calls, DOM manipulati=
on, subscriptions, etc.</p>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">useEffect provide <strong>contro=
lled way</strong> =C4=91=E1=BB=83 handle side effects trong functional comp=
onents, maintain functional programming principles while enabling practical=
 applications.</p>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Side Effect Categories</=
strong>:</p>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Data fetching</strong>:=
 API calls, database queries</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Subscriptions</strong>:=
 WebSocket connections, event listeners</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>DOM manipulation</stron=
g>: Focus management, animations</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Cleanup</strong>: Timer=
 clearing, connection closing</li>
</ul>
<h4 class=3D"text-base font-bold text-text-100 mt-1">=F0=9F=94=AC useEffect=
