nders</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Integrating v=E1=BB=9Bi imperat=
ive APIs</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Performance-critical mutable st=
ate</li>
</ul>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Use useState when</stron=
g>:</p>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
