<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Need re-render on value change<=
/li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Following React's declarative p=
atterns</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">State needs to participate tron=
g component lifecycle</li>
</ul>
